1
00:00:05,319 --> 00:00:06,117
Kongkwan…

2
00:00:06,141 --> 00:00:09,659
Kongkwan went to the restroom. Do you have
something you want to talk to her about today?

3
00:00:11,059 --> 00:00:12,180
Kongkwan?

4
00:00:12,280 --> 00:00:15,280
Yes?

5
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:19,520
I have something important to tell you, Kongkwan.

6
00:00:19,520 --> 00:00:25,680
Earth… I don't know
what my dad told you, but—

7
00:00:25,680 --> 00:00:30,240
Just so both sides understand clearly…

8
00:00:30,240 --> 00:00:32,894
Yes? This is P'Gun and Earth.

9
00:00:34,335 --> 00:00:35,063
P'Gun…

10
00:00:36,120 --> 00:00:40,098
Yes. Earth and I… we're in love.

11
00:00:48,640 --> 00:00:52,640
So that means…
Uncle doesn't know about this yet, right?

12
00:00:52,640 --> 00:00:58,640
Uncle—your dad—probably doesn't know yet.
I… haven't told him.

13
00:00:58,640 --> 00:01:02,512
Dad is really stubborn,
so I wanted to tell you first.

14
00:01:05,017 --> 00:01:11,812
Honestly, I've been really uncomfortable too…
But thank you so much, P'Gun, for being honest with me.

15
00:01:11,812 --> 00:01:17,934
I'm really happy right now.
Actually… I also have something to tell you.

16
00:01:18,759 --> 00:01:21,066
To be honest…
I already have a boyfriend.

17
00:01:30,079 --> 00:01:32,800
From now on,
you don't have to worry anymore, Gun.
